<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westfield Trust half yr profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westfield Trust half yr profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     122.0 vs 108.3</p>
<p>First half distribution (cents)  9.97 vs 9.77</p>
<p>NOTE: Westfield Trust is a shopping centre owner.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		    118.7 vs 108.3</p>
<p>    Sales				   217.6 vs 169.3</p>
<p>    Other income			    0.5 vs 0.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  3.3 vs nil</p>
<p>Distribution pay date August 29</p>
<p>Reg date August 16</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 26.1 vs 4.9</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
